Offline partition can cause loss of transaction markers
During the rewrite of the KRaftMetadataCache (as part of KAFKA-17573), a bug was introduced which causes transaction coordinator to drop transaction markers for a partition if the leader is missing (offline). Specifically, {{metadataCache.getPartitionLeaderEndpoint}} returns {{None}} instead of {{Some(Node.noNode).}}

This bug can cause hanging transaction and lost commit markers. Thanks [~alivshits] for the identification of this issue.

